          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸ್ವೀಕರಿಸು — svīkarisu — \"to accept; to receive\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅವಳು ಹೊಸ ಕೆಲಸದ ಆಹ್ವಾನವನ್ನು ಸ್ವೀಕರಿಸಿದಳು. avaḷu hosa kelasada āhvānavannu svīkarisidaḷu. She accepted the offer of a new job."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಸ್ವೀಕರಿಸಿದೆ, svīkariside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal. ಸ್ವೀಕಾರ, acceptance."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸ್ವೀಕರಿಸು (svīkarisu) is built on Sanskrit svīkāra, \"making one's own\" (Monier-Williams), with the Kannada verb ending -isu."
            }
          ]
        },
